                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                        "entry_id": "4d9c8f03-0c07-38de-a000-0df84be8675f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To cause someone to become unemployed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5631e2d5-eee4-4ffd-9464-e439bc522dcb",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "In addition, new technologies are adopted which are less labour-using, thus unemploying workers. Over the postwar years, factors of this sort have contributed to a gradual upward drift in unemployment rates, even during expansions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ffbbd52-b18b-455a-95a3-6a9c9f48c264",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "It is, however, a reality that some developers are concerned that code generators and the like will \"unemploy\" them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54c1ee6d-daec-4016-b98a-a631c7c12e99",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "\"Put us all out of business, especially you, Cathy. One of the first things they'll edit out of the human genome is myopia, and diabetes and that — \" \"It'll unemploy you before it unemploys me, Professor,\" Cathy said with an impish smile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad2fcd57-20c6-4104-a511-b871e25e6ab9",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "Agriculture, which is arguably the biggest business in the world, is also the single most environmentally destructive human activity. It is increasingly technology based and “unemploys” people at a dramatic rate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6064876-9c2f-4d3a-9cbc-562d46f86bc8",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "“This is off the record. If one word of this appears in your tabloid, I will use all my wealth and connections to shut it down and unemploy you permanently.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4d7680d-356f-4543-8634-be7fa0c3ddd4",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "Oh, good! Who's that guy? I bet he's a terror! What's he been, sabotaging Egypt's infrastructure? Or harassing Egyptian women on the streets? Or unemploying Egyptian people? What's he do?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4eed4e74-1db5-4c54-9fc1-e25facf451eb",
                                "sense_id": "1972296f-689e-304f-8532-b030dbd00650",
                                "text": "Advocating any policy to raise wages that does not raise these bounds risks raising workers' compensation above their productivity; thus, unemploying the workers that the activists were trying to help."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
